{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BXz7khp3lt1795748232.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價升近4年半高位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價，報6.7075，較上個交易日上調21點子，是自2022年7月11日以來的高位。</p><p></p><p>現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價升穿6.66水平，早段於6.65水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外人民銀行開展7,940億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放2,225億元人民幣。全周計算，淨投放9,145億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.063470+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:34:30.297246+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:14.454934+00:00","content_hash":"5c609fbf698c03e4a3f63487306dfe4625379e38bb97c2eadb97c6a2961d3d61","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.063470+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}